OL,3,AWhite House lifts tariffs on some
OL,4,ACanadian goods as midterm elections
OL,5,Aloom
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Trump administration is lifting
OL,8,Fsome of its 50% tariffs on Canadian
OL,9,Fgoods two weeks before the midterm
OL,10,Felections, after a Republican candidate
OL,11,Fin a key Senate race said she had
OL,12,Flobbied for the change.
OL,14,FStarting on 30 October, tariffs will be
OL,15,Feased on products including "plywood
OL,16,Fsheets, some paper products, certain
OL,17,Fmachinery and refrigeration equipment,"
OL,18,Fthe White House said on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
